WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:01.620
- I'd love for you to take a look

00:00:01.620 --> 00:00:03.890
at another one of my favorite spots

00:00:03.890 --> 00:00:07.860
in this gorgeous golden state.

00:00:07.860 --> 00:00:10.443
(upbeat music)

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:14.970
I truly love Joshua Tree,

00:00:14.970 --> 00:00:18.470
it's a short drive from Palm Springs.

00:00:18.470 --> 00:00:21.350
It just means so much to me personally,

00:00:21.350 --> 00:00:23.970
I've gone to Joshua Tree my whole life,

00:00:23.970 --> 00:00:28.080
and I actually spread
my father's ashes there,

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:30.550
because it was his favorite place.

00:00:30.550 --> 00:00:34.770
And the two of us would
tool around there together,

00:00:34.770 --> 00:00:38.200
and there's really no place quite like it.

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:40.970
It's one of the wonders that we have,

00:00:40.970 --> 00:00:43.070
and I can't recommend it more.

00:00:43.070 --> 00:00:46.900
It's deeply spiritual and
I would get yourself there

00:00:46.900 --> 00:00:48.757
as quickly as possible.

00:00:48.757 --> 00:00:52.856
"Drew's Cali" is sponsored
by Visit California.

00:00:52.856 --> 00:00:55.439
(bright music)

